{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2014-02", "window": 2, "start_date": 1391817600, "end_date": 1392422399, "month_true_total": 691, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:08:02 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "9110878", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010451177", "personaname": "Dythronix", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Dythronix/", "num_games_owned": 424, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 4158, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3298, "last_played": 1591922120, "avatar": "a5add6dc73ab35760120fdc8fae25458a447dfdf"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10 Would've bought it even if it wasn't on sale.\n\n   This game encompasses many of the Rogue-like qualities that are pinned to it, and really gives that experience of omnipotence. One minute you're slowly toiling away through a few enemies and the next you're doing as you please with hordes all around you. A must buy for anyone into the 2D 16-bit aesthetic and progression that isn't impeded by permanent death.", "timestamp_created": 1392421871, "timestamp_updated": 1393737863, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.566929101943969727", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9110532", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999874898", "personaname": "Mirror", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mirror_eclipse/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 1674, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 626, "last_played": 1543960004, "avatar": "a84ebdb622c75b37b1a859bff1f10fd11fe139de"}, "language": "english", "review": "Absolutely absurd difficulty, even on normal mode. And it's not a bad thing. While dying early on in a run can be stressful in many games, this game makes it feel much less painful. Beating the entire game takes about 50 minutes-an hour, so when you die you're really not losing that much progress. With a lot of unlockables and numerous playable characters, this is one game I'm glad I didn't miss out on.", "timestamp_created": 1392420221, "timestamp_updated": 1392420221, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9110367", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032239906", "personaname": "nosrettO", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lukiyboi/", "num_games_owned": 448, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2721, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1433, "last_played": 1435625362, "avatar": "cde80f50ba4fa74abbd3f7b2b44354ef8e3b1685"}, "language": "english", "review": "Organised chaos. That is all. Now buy it.", "timestamp_created": 1392419517, "timestamp_updated": 1392419517, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9110123", "author": {"steamid": "76561198105765108", "personaname": "Crispycol", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198105765108/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2035, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 321, "last_played": 1493074159, "avatar": "5c93c400f9c59c99234cced754809e0bbc8b3bd4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very awesome game. Although I hate when too many monsters spawn I keep playing it over and over again... just because. Certainly a game I would recommand.", "timestamp_created": 1392418449, "timestamp_updated": 1392418449, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9109980", "author": {"steamid": "76561198124415749", "personaname": "Quixotic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198124415749/", "num_games_owned": 238, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 2050, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1119, "last_played": 1568628979, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is absolutely amazing! Awesome pixel graphics, fantastic soundtrack, combat is fast and intense. Lots of replay value. It's a lot of fun! \n\nSetting up an online multiplayer game is a pain at the moment, hope it will get it's own dedicated lobby in the future. Full controller support would have been nice.\n\n8/10", "timestamp_created": 1392417836, "timestamp_updated": 1393152073, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9109665", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028721484", "personaname": "Kiwi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198028721484/", "num_games_owned": 837, "num_reviews": 185, "playtime_forever": 810, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 188, "last_played": 1521257689, "avatar": "84ea15ccf46c7f99763c408479e1ddaeddd7769d"}, "language": "english", "review": "An addictive, and abusive game that will have you frustrated, and wanting more.", "timestamp_created": 1392416711, "timestamp_updated": 1392416711, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9109602", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996972442", "personaname": "Gremlin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197996972442/", "num_games_owned": 1339, "num_reviews": 345, "playtime_forever": 167, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19, "last_played": 1501373190, "avatar": "16d47ec9cc933f32446a23d374be8907926e36a9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Everything but the jellyfish in this game are good. The ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ jellyfish were a terrible idea and whoever thought they were good is stupid. You do not make a ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ platformer where you have an enemy where you can't TARGET fly very fast at you in the middle of combat... then get the bright idea of spawning MILLIONS of them. There is no ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ excuse for amping the difficult up by poor combat mechanics.", "timestamp_created": 1392416516, "timestamp_updated": 1392416516, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.344887673854827881", "comment_count": 4, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}